  "description": "Full of Love Daycare ensures each child is ready for the 21st century, and its hunky teachers are the heart-stopping crushes of all the town moms. Plunked in between her muscle-clad and pretty boy colleagues, can the newly-hired female teacher Seun-Gah survive the glares of jealous mothers, let alone the hectic kids in her class? More importantly, can she resist all the eye-candy around her?! \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
